+msgid "Bitwise Operations"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: plugins/numtheory/plugin.xml.in.h:2
+msgid "Number Theory"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: plugins/numtheory/plugin.xml.in.h:3
+msgid ""
+"Several basic utilities for prime numbers, pi, phi, sigma. It also holds "
+"some simple bitwise operations."
+msgstr ""
